Depends: bash, python3, mawk | gawk, gcc, g++, gdb, gnome-terminal | xterm, libc6 (>= 2.31), libgtk2.0-0 (>= 2.24), libglib2.0-0 (>= 2.56), libgdk-pixbuf2.0-0 (>= 2.36.11) | libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0 (>= 2.36.11), libpango-1.0-0 (>= 1.40), libcairo2 (>= 1.14), libatk1.0-0 (>= 2.18), libx11-6
Recommends: fonts-dejavu-core, fonts-noto-cjk, astyle
Description: dev-cpp-linux - C/C++ IDE for NOI Linux
 dev-cpp-linux is a native GTK2 Lazarus port of Orwell Dev-C++ 5.11 for NOI Linux 2.0.
 Includes the prebuilt IDE, editor resources and console runner. GCC, G++,
 GDB and a graphical terminal are installed as runtime dependencies.
